# Contributing to Jamal Universe

Thanks for your interest in contributing! Here's how to help.

## 🐛 Reporting Bugs

Open an [Issue](../../issues/new) and include:
- **Console output** (screenshot or copy-paste of the DevTools console)
- **Discord client** — Desktop / Web / Vesktop
- **Steps to reproduce**
- **Script version** (shown in the panel header, e.g. `v3.9`)

## 💡 Suggesting Features

Open an [Issue](../../issues/new) tagged `enhancement` describing:
- What problem it solves
- How you imagine it working

## 🔧 Pull Requests

1. Fork the repo
2. Create a branch: `git checkout -b feature/my-feature`
3. Make your changes to the `.js` file
4. Test in an actual Discord console before submitting
5. Open a PR with a clear description of what changed and why

## 🧪 Testing Checklist

Before submitting a PR, verify:
- [ ] Script loads without console errors
- [ ] Quest picker shows available quests correctly
- [ ] VIDEO quests progress and complete
- [ ] GAME quests progress and complete (Discord Desktop only)
- [ ] Pause → resume doesn't lose progress
- [ ] History panel opens/closes without breaking the quest view
- [ ] ✕ Close button fully tears down the UI

## 📜 Code Style

- No external dependencies — must run standalone in a browser console
- Keep DOM manipulation vanilla JS (no frameworks)
- Comment any Discord webpack module patching clearly
- Test against the latest Discord Desktop build before submitting
